# Vantorax Studio V3

Static HTML/CSS/vanilla JS. No build step. GitHub Pages ready.

## Images
`assets/images/*.svg` are generated stylized illustrations (no photography), so nothing is broken. For the photographic look, replace them with real or AI-generated photos using the same names (switch the extension to .jpg/.webp in the HTML). Needed: hero-kitchen, kitchen-heritage, kitchen-luxury, bathroom-spa, home-remodel, detail-material, site-before, site-after.
Prompt style: "Ultra-realistic editorial architectural photograph of a luxury contemporary kitchen renovation, warm oak cabinetry, marble island, soft morning light, 35mm, no people, no text, no logos."

## Deploy
Push to GitHub, enable Pages, then replace `YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/vantorax-v3` in canonicals, robots.txt and sitemap.xml.

## Form
Set `ENDPOINT` in `js/main.js`. Until then the form validates and states nothing was sent.

